Magical Garden v2.1.0

This application is provided for personal password management purposes. It runs entirely offline: no analytics, no network calls, and no external services are contacted at any point.

Your master password is never written to disk. Only a salted PBKDF2-HMAC-SHA256 derivation (600,000 iterations) is used to unlock a Fernet (AES-128-CBC + HMAC-SHA256) encrypted vault file stored next to this program.

By design there is no password-recovery backdoor: if sunlight.key is lost, deleted, or corrupted, the existing garden.enc vault cannot be decrypted by simply setting a new password. The application will instead require an explicit, typed confirmation before an old vault can be erased and a new one created.

You are responsible for backing up garden.enc and sunlight.key together, and for remembering your Master Key.

